B. Augmented Reality Head-Up Display Concept
1) Requirements Definition:

Whereas there are already guidelines for the design of the instrument cluster [46] , [47] and recommendations for the design of the HMI for automated driving [48] , [49] , there are still no design principles for the ARHUD [50] , [51] . We therefore collected quantitative and qualitative requirements resulting from ARHUD studies or transferred from conventional HMI concepts to the ARHUD context ( Table I and Table II ). This should provide a basis for the development of the ARHUD in this paper.
